{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12386","headline":"送张中丞赴桂州 · 钱起","name":"送张中丞赴桂州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"出守求人瘼，推贤动圣情。\n紫台初下诏，皁盖始专城。\n宠借飞霜简，威加却月营。\n云衢降五马，林木引双旌。\n夙仰敦诗礼，尝闻偃甲兵。\n戍楼云外静，讼阁竹间清。\n化伫还珠美，心将片玉贞。\n寇恂朝望重，计日谒承明。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12386.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12386","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}